@startuml Context_Diagram_for_PNP-SPT_Platform
left to right direction
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<process>> #F5F5F5
  BorderColor<<process>> #424242
  BackgroundColor<<trainee>> #EDE7F6
  BorderColor<<trainee>> #673AB7
  BackgroundColor<<supervisor>> #E0F2F1
  BorderColor<<supervisor>> #00897B
  BackgroundColor<<admin>> #FFF8E1
  BorderColor<<admin>> #FFA000
  BackgroundColor<<external>> #FBE9E7
  BorderColor<<external>> #E64A19
  BackgroundColor<<store>> #ECEFF1
  BorderColor<<store>> #607D8B
}

title Context Diagram for PNP-SPT Platform

rectangle "PNP Trainees" as trainees <<trainee>>
rectangle "Supervisor" as supervisor <<supervisor>>
rectangle "Admin\n(IT Department)" as admin <<admin>>
rectangle "AI Chatbot" as aiChatbot <<external>>
rectangle "SPT Database" as sptDb <<store>>

rectangle "PNP-SPT Platform\n(Central Process)" as sptPlatform <<process>>

trainees --> sptPlatform : Register & log in
trainees --> sptPlatform : Submit training progress
supervisor --> sptPlatform : Manage training content
supervisor --> sptPlatform : Monitor training progress
admin --> sptPlatform : Configure infrastructure
admin --> sptPlatform : Manage AI integration

sptPlatform --> aiChatbot : Send curriculum-scoped\nprompts (no PII)
aiChatbot --> sptPlatform : Return tutoring responses

sptPlatform --> sptDb : Read/write curriculum,\nprogress & certificate data

note bottom of sptPlatform
  Runs on its own separate domain.
  No live connection to POA exists
  during development or at handover.
end note

@enduml
